  "notes": "Inputs 1-2 are combo XLR/6.35 mm jack: mic on XLR, line or instrument (INST) on jack. Kensington lock not listed. Line Inputs 3-6 and Line Outputs 1-4 are rear 6.35 mm TRS jacks. Two front headphone outputs. S/PDIF in/out on RCA (inputs 7-8, outputs 5-6). MIDI In/Out are 5-pin DIN. Powered by the supplied 12 V DC adapter (not listed); not USB bus-powered. Routing via Focusrite Control.",
